  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v4.0.0-alpha.6: consumer-driven hardening from live multi-tenant integration feedback (cold-audit + go/no-go remediation), including RBAC write/read-path fixes, a first-class system/service-account executor (RunAsSystemAsync), an IMyIdentityConfigurationService abstraction, and full XML API documentation. Contains breaking changes. See UPGRADE.md for the full changelog. API may still change before stable.",
